WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

NOTE English subtitles for the Hungarian video tour. The spoken lines are
translated; the silent sections carry a caption describing what is on screen.

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
What if you lived in one of the
liveliest parts of Budapest...

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.500
...and yet, the moment you got home,
the noise of the city simply stopped?

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Park Residence. Gated entrance,
camera monitored, two spacious lifts.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Corvin sétány: shops, restaurants
and the M3 metro, all on foot.

5
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.000
A Lidl 100 metres away,
Corvin Plaza at 300 metres.

6
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.500
Cafés and restaurants
right on the promenade.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Step free from the street
all the way to the door.

8
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.500
The living area: 21.28 m²,
with windows onto the inner garden.

9
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.500
Fifth floor of a building
completed in 2017.

10
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
The terrace runs along the garden side.
The dining area opens into the living space.

11
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:54.500
The bedrooms: 15.21 m² and 11.22 m²,
with fitted wardrobes and solid wood furniture.

12
00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:02.500
The kitchen is fully fitted: AEG induction hob,
built in oven, microwave and dishwasher.

13
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Solid wood cabinetry throughout.
Available with the flat, by agreement.

14
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.500
The M3 metro and the night tram:
the city stays reachable at any hour.

15
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.500
The flat has a spacious living room
with an open kitchen,

16
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.000
a large double bedroom,

17
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.000
which can be turned back into
two separate rooms at any time.

18
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Above the trees of the inner garden,
on the fifth floor of ten.

19
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:34.000
Central heating on an individual meter,
2017 insulation, low running costs.

20
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.500
This home is not
just square metres,

21
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.400
it is a way of living.

22
00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:43.500
In the middle of the city,
and still far from its noise.

23
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.500
This may be exactly
what you have been looking for.

24
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.400
Corvin sétány 5/b, fifth floor.
